.modal-header
  %h3
    Are you
    %strong ABSOLUTELY
    sure?
.modal-body
  %p
    This will delete your account and also terminate all the boxes you own.
  %p
    Collaborators you added to those boxes, will also
    %strong lose access to data.

.modal-footer
  %button.btn(_action='didClickCancel target="view"')
    No, Take me back
  %a.btn.btn-danger(href='/users' data-method='delete' rel='nofollow')
    Yes, Delete my account
